  "hindi": "जो स्वर्ण के रंग वाले, शुद्ध और पावन हैं, जिनमें सविता उत्पन्न हुआ, जिनमें अग्नि है; जिन सुन्दर रंग वाली (जलों) ने अग्नि को गर्भ के रूप में धारण किया, वे जल हमारे लिए कल्याणकारी और सुखद हों।",
  "english": "The golden-coloured, bright, purifying waters, in which Savitṛ was born and in which Agni is: the fair-coloured waters that bore Agni as their embryo: may those waters be wholesome and kindly for us.",
  "text_flags": [],
  "notes": "The first line has no stated noun; 'āpaḥ' in line 2 supplies it (this verse and the next three share one refrain). Savitar, Agni and Varuṇa are kept as names. The unit is one sentence, with 'in which Agni (is)' supplying the verb.",
  "confidence": "high",
  "type": "verse",
  "line_ids": [
   "001.033.1a",
   "001.033.1b"
  ],
  "lines_deva": [
   "हिर॑ण्यवर्णाः॒ शुच॑यः पाव॒का यासु॑ जा॒तः स॑वि॒ता यास्व॒ग्निः",
   "या अ॒ग्निं गर्भं॑ दधि॒रे सु॒वर्णा॒स्ता न॒ आपः॒ शं स्यो॒ना भ॑वन्तु"
  ],
  "lines_iast": [
